docs {
  ## Get Homepage Data

  Public endpoint. Returns homepage data (latest gigs, jobs, and tuitions).

  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "latest_gigs": [...],
      "latest_jobs": [...],
      "stats": { ... }
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Error Responses
  - **500** — Server error
}
